          "_name": "image1",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image1\" group=\"Images & Videos\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDescription\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/lovelies-trio-booksale-s-1.png\" alt=\"Love Lies, romantic suspense, contemporary romance novel\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style pt-2 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n                    Image Description</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg' : !fullWidth, 'col-lg-4' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth >= 6, 'col-lg-6' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth <= 5}\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b>Image with Description</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><b>\"<i>A gripping romantic suspense... Blending emotional intensity with high-stakes tension.</i>\" — CANREADS BOOK REVIEWS<br><br>\"<i>An engrossing, captivating romance novel!</i>\"&nbsp;— JF</b><br><br>Amy Beckett was the perfect accessory for her fiancé James Devlin's high-society life. Until she wasn't. James didn't just break her heart; he leveraged it. Leaving her homeless, drowning in debt, and silenced by his ultimatum. And when the ruthless billionaire Harold Bancroft threatens to evict her beloved café Maddy's Place, Amy realizes she is one step away from losing everything.<br><br><b>Matthew Warren is the Senior Counsel hired to make sure she does.<br></b><br>Matthew is the most ruthless lawyer in the state. He wins in the courtrooms and bleeds in the shadows, haunted by a past he can't litigate away. He doesn't do love and he certainly doesn't do feelings.<br><br><b>His world of cold logic meets a fire he can't extinguish.<br></b><br>Matthew's cool professionalism slips when he witnesses Amy's pain, and the way he looks at her suggests he knows exactly what it means to be broken. What begins as a forbidden alliance deepens into an all-consuming passion.<br>Amy must trust the man who plays by no rules.<br>Matthew must prove he's nothing like the men who came before him.<br><br>But as Amy fights to protect her future, the ghosts of the past refuse to stay buried, forcing her to decide:<br><br><b>Is she brave enough to survive?<br>Or is love just another lie?</b><br></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
