          "_name": "image1",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image1\" group=\"Images & Videos\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDescription\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/surrender-kindle-booksale-s.png\" alt=\"Surrender, Book Two St. Austell Duet, Billionaire Romance, Second Chance Romance \">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style pt-2 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\"><i>Surrender is the final installment in the St. Austell Duet.<br>Emma and Edward's journey begins in Shattered.</i><br></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg' : !fullWidth, 'col-lg-4' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth >= 6, 'col-lg-6' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth <= 5}\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b>Image with Description</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><b>\"<i>Tight and tense. Good writing.</i>\" — ROBIN K., PAGE TURNER AWARDS JUDGE</b><br><br><b>\"<i>You feel like you are stepping in between the images and observing the story as it unfolds.</i>\" — DAWN C.</b><br><br>Emma Kinsley is pouring the shattered pieces of her heart into her new interior design career. She survived the brutal shock of Edward Hughes's true identity and the agonizing tabloid rumors of his Manhattan fiancée. She has mastered the art of pretending she is whole, swearing she will never let the man who broke her get close enough to do it again.<br><br><b>Until her phone lights up in the dead of night.</b><br><br>An ocean away, Edward's carefully controlled world has completely collapsed. The vicious public exposure of his adoption was only the beginning. Faced with the tragic death of his biological mother, the Manhattan billionaire is stripped of everything he thought he knew.<br><br><b>Hiding the truth cost him the only woman he ever loved.</b><br><br>Broken and desperate for the one person who truly sees him, he calls Emma with an unthinkable plea: cross the Atlantic and stand by his side as he faces the ghosts of his past. To do it, she'll have to walk straight back into the high-society snake pit that tore them apart in the first place.<br><br><b>But Edward has nothing left to hide, and everything to lose.</b><br><br>He is playing for keeps. And Emma is trapped between two impossible choices:<br><br><b>Keep pretending she can actually survive without him?<br>Or surrender to a second chance that could ruin her for good?</b><br></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
