          "_name": "features5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features5\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showsubTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#fafafa\" condition=\"showLink\" selected>\n\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n            <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"6\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n        </select>\n\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background3.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image mb-4 col-12 col-md-{{columns}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-7\">\n                            <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                                <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showsubTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">St. Austell Duet, Book One</h6>\n                                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Shattered</b></h5>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b><i>You can't bury a Manhattan scandal in Cornish Sand.<br></i></b><br>She sought the ocean to be alone with her grief. He crossed an ocean to disappear.<br><br><br></p>\n                                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a href=\"shattered.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">TELL ME MORE</a></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-5\">\n                            <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n                                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/shattered-bookandspine-3d-1.png\" alt=\"Shattered, St. Austell Book 1, Small Town Romance\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image mb-4 col-12 col-md-{{columns}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-7\">\n                            <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                                <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showsubTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">St. Austell Duet, Book Two</h6>\n                                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Surrender</b></h5>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b><i>She fell in love with a man who didn't exist. Now she has to face the billionaire who does.<br></i></b><br>She deleted his number to survive the heartbreak. He dialed hers because he was suffocating without her.</p>\n                                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a href=\"surrender.html\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">TELL ME MORE</a></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-5\">\n                            <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n                                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/surrender-bookandspine-3d-1.png\" alt=\"Surrender, St. Austell Book 2, Contemporary Romance\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vkN75SIwal",
